# PerJaus

Backend: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Edge Functions)
Frontend: React + Vite + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui
Bot: Telegram + Gemini 1.5 Flash

## Variables de entorno requeridas

```bash
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
```

## Edge Function

```bash
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
```
